{"productId": "7780fe90-294e-4f1a-87e7-8983a7060725", "modelName": "Brawler", "modelDescription": " For when you only need one shot, there\u2019s the Rossi Brawler. You can throw down on anything from rattlesnakes to medium-sized game thanks to the Brawler\u2019s ability to fire either 45 Colt or a 410 shotshell. Plus, with the integrated picatinny rail, you\u2019re also not stuck using one grain weight ammo. You can attach any optic of your choice to the Brawler and zero your point of impact exactly. This is your next adventure gun. A simple break-action and cross bolt safety give you the same ruggedness as a flint axe. The Brawler\u2019s trigger is another point of simplicity \u2013 a single action trigger. Cock the hammer, fire the shot, reload. No messing around with the Brawler. The rubbergrip cushions your hand against 410 shotshell recoil from the mildist birdshot up to serious 3 inch 410 bore magnum ammo. Throw down with the Brawler today, and you\u2019ll be prepared for anything the woods can throw at you. ", "manufacturerName": "Rossi", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "4d568f52-dcb5-49b2-b2f4-375a93bc747f", "description": "Rossi, Brawler, 300 Blackout, 9\" Threaded Barrel, OD Green, 1 Round", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/92c66169-fb2a-4a09-88c4-d07352372e3a"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "SSPB9300-OD", "upc": "754908378609", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "2fa81b83-a1b1-4729-b87f-fbaba467061c", "attributeName": "Caliber", "attributeValueId": "2755082a-1a71-4651-a39f-a92ab47b9f30", "valueName": "300 AAC Blackout"}, {"attributeNameId": "70a78e78-6640-4f36-af23-93d050b3c0b2", "attributeName": "Capacity", "attributeValueId": "b1c5e58e-104d-4cee-82e6-b7afeabf4c77", "valueName": "1 Round"}, {"attributeNameId": "1dbab5b3-c07e-4fd5-93de-487557a9fe2d", "attributeName": "Factory Equipped Sights", "attributeValueId": "15b89746-c931-407f-af1d-ea83c38a6c08", "valueName": "Fixe